Target detection from a record: check token membership in the string values of target-ish fields; for class tokens map to target. Also for artifact paths.

Pin extraction: fields artifact_sha256, reviewed_sha256, sha256, cited_sha256, target_evidence, evidence_refs; plus nested dicts under 'target'/'artifact'; plus target_id strings containing '#<hex>'. Return set of lowercase hex substrings of length>=12 found anywhere in those selected strings (regex [0-9a-f]{12,64}).

Binding to target epoch: any pin p such that p.startswith(h[:12]) or h.startswith(p[:12]).

